{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35633","headline":"赠弹琴李处士 · 李山甫","name":"赠弹琴李处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"情知此事少知音，自是先生枉用心。\n世上几时曾好古，人前何必更沾襟。\n致身不似笙竽巧，悦耳宁如郑卫淫。\n三尺焦桐七条线，子期师旷两沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}